Patterns
Structured Output with Schema
The harness instructs the coding agent to write validated JSON to a file. On parse failure, it attempts cosmetic repair (fixing markdown fences, trailing commas, unclosed brackets), then sends a follow-up prompt, then retries from scratch.


class ArchitectureAnalysis(BaseModel):
    components: list[str]
    dependencies: dict[str, list[str]]
    risk_areas: list[str]
    migration_effort: str  # "low", "medium", "high"
result = await app.harness(
    "Analyze the architecture of this codebase and identify migration risks.",
    schema=ArchitectureAnalysis,
    cwd="/path/to/project",
)
if not result.is_error:
    analysis = result.parsed
    print(f"Risk areas: {analysis.risk_areas}")
    print(f"Migration effort: {analysis.migration_effort}")
